4. Knots. A blended strip of n cells holds 2n + 9, and 713 rows of 2 x 731 + 9 is the failure's number:
   713 x 1471 = 1048823, failure said 1048823, EQUAL
   so cells4 on the 6.4 plate needs 1075301 of 1048576, 102.5%, and stopped at row 713 of 731.
   A plate's live knots, % of the limit, by subject and rung (row and column counts from each candidate's receipt):
